# Architecture

- Modules: `:app`, `:core:domain`, `:core:data`, `:core:ui`, features, `:source:api|ao3|ficbook`
- Domain has no Android/Room/OkHttp dependencies
- Data implements repositories; features depend inward
- Source adapters implement `:source:api` only; do not parse AO3 inside Ficbook module
- Room entities stay in `:core:data`; map to domain models at boundary
- Prefer hand-written fakes in tests for repository/source/translator interfaces
